WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.652
The Ace to Five of Cups follow feelings from an
opening of the heart to loss and reappraisal.

00:00:06.652 --> 00:00:09.466
Each card has an upright and a reversed
meaning.

00:00:10.766 --> 00:00:11.514
Ace of Cups.

00:00:11.514 --> 00:00:14.257
New feeling, openness, emotional
beginnings.

00:00:14.257 --> 00:00:19.868
A hand reaches from a cloud holding a cup that
overflows with water, with a dove above it.

00:00:21.168 --> 00:00:21.868
Two of Cups.

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:24.200
Partnership, mutual respect, connection.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:29.040
Two figures exchange cups, and above them
hovers a winged lion's head over a staff.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.825
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:32.825 --> 00:00:37.661
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
